        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "49. What do we learn about the countryside with industrialisation and technological advances?\nA) It is destined to change gradually. C) It is likely to embrace foreign cultures.\nB) It will present an idealised way of life. D) It will become increasingly diversified.",
      "block_bbox": [
        68,
        951,
        976,
        1039
      ],
      "block_id": 7,
      "block_order": 8,
      "group_id": 7,
      "block_polygon_points": [
