    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "50. What does the author think of the future of the countryside compared with cities?\nA) It is going to be harder for the locals. C) It is less likely to stay static.\nB) It is going to resemble that of cities. D) It is less easy to envisage.",
